{\n    \"header\": \"What if there is an issue with my order?\",\n    \"body\": \"We are committed to providing a positive shopping experience for our customers at Zenni. If you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, you may return your glasses within 14 days of receiving your order for a full refund, or within 30 days of receiving your order for store credit. To start a return, you can contact our \u003ca href=\\\"https://www.zennioptical.com/help?a=Contact-Us---id--T53VsfyYTF-eEQGumYnL5g\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003ecustomer support\u003c/a\u003e team.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"header\": \"How do I get reimbursed for my purchase through HSA/FSA?\",\n    \"body\": \"You can access your HSA/FSA receipt from the Orders tab in your account by clicking “Print HSA/FSA receipt.” From there, you can submit this receipt, along with any required claim form, to your plan administrator. Please check your provider’s website for their specific claim process.\"\n  }\n]48:T3356,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"[\n  {\n    \"catName\": \"Sunglasses\",\n    \"subCats\": [\n      {\n        \"subCatName\": \"Trending\",\n        \"tints\": [\n          {\n            \"tintName\": \"Dark Gray\",\n            \"tintClass\": \"sunglass-solid-dark-gray\",\n            \"fittingBoxId\": \"ZENNI_DarkGray\",\n            \"enableExposureLevel\": false\n          },\n          {\n            \"tintName\": \"Dark Amber\",\n            \"tintClass\": \"sunglass-solid-dark-amber\",\n            \"fittingBoxId\": \"ZENNI_DarkAmber\",\n            \"enableExposureLevel\": false\n          },\n          {\n            \"tintName\": \"Silver Mirror\",\n            \"tintClass\": \"mirror-solid-silver\",\n            \"fittingBoxId\": \"ZENNI_SilverMirror\",\n            \"enableExposureLevel\": false\n          },\n          {\n            \"tintName\": \"Indigo Blue Mirror\",\n            \"tintClass\": \"mirror-solid-indigo-blue\",\n            \"fittingBoxId\": \"ZENNI_IndigoBl