 for rewards members on orders of $89 and above.\",\"i18n.cart.cartItem.prescriptionType.progressive\":\"Progressive\",\"i18n.cart.toast.addedToCart\":\"Added to Cart\",\"i18n.global.extendedWarranty.modal.addWarranty\":\"Add Extended Warranty\",\"i18n.cart.orderSummary.discountLabel\":\"Discount\",\"i18n.cart.upgradeWarranty.learnMore\":\"Learn More\",\"i18n.cart.orderSummary.savingsLabel\":\"Savings\",\"account.favorites.shareFavoriteCard\":\"{\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"Share My Favorites\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"Share a public link to your favorites page to share your impeccable taste with friends.\\\",\\n  \\\"shareButtonText\\\": \\\"Share My Favorites\\\",\\n  \\\"unpublishLinkButtonText\\\": \\\"Unpublish Link\\\",\\n  \\\"modalTitle\\\": \\\"Share Your Favorites\\\",\\n  \\\"copyText\\\": \\\"Copy\\\",\\n  \\\"copiedText\\\": \\\"Copied\\\",\\n  \\\"modalDescriptionList\\\": [\\n    \\\"Only people with the link can view your list.\\\",\\n    \\\"Updates automatically as you change your favorites.\\\",\\n    \\\"Unpublish anytime you wish.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"createShareableLinkButtonText\\\": \\\"Create Shareable Link\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"i18n.common.questionCards.backButtonText\":\"Back\",\"i18n.common.questionCards.nextButtonText\":\"Next\",\"global.product.size.related.nosepad\":\"Nosepad Comfort\",\"global.product.size.related.nosepadStandard\":\"Standard\",\"i18n.common.windowStyleGlasses.skuIds\":\"[\\n  \\\"1010412\\\",\\n  \\\"1010418\\\",\\n  \\\"1010421\\\",\\n  \\\"1010424\\\",\\n  \\\"1010517\\\",\\n  \\\"1010521\\\",\\n  \\\"1010522\\\",\\n  \\\"1010542\\\",\\n  \\\"1010612\\\",\\n  \\\"1010616\\\",\\n  \\\"1010623\\\",\\n  \\\"1010624\\\",\\n  \\\"1010721\\\",\\n  \\\"1010722\\\",\\n  \\\"1010724\\\",\\n  \\\"1010742\\\",\\n  \\\"1010817\\\",\\n  \\\"1010822\\\",\\n  \\\"1010824\\\",\\n  \\\"1010830\\\"\\n]\",\"pdp.tabs.nav.fitSize\":\"Prescription \u0026 Size\",\"account.rewards.featuredContentConfig\":\"$3a\",\"account.rewards.compareTableConfig\":\"$3b\",\"plp.appliedFilters.clearFiltersMobile\":\"Clear all\",\"global.plp.frontView.label\":\"Front view\",\"account.rewards.unlockRewardsConfig\":\"{\\n  \\\"cards\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"Unlock free standard shipping on each order $89 or more by joining Zenni Rewards.\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Free shipping\\\",\\n      \\\"backgroundColor\\\": \\\"--gray-100\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"Earn 1.5 or 2 points for every $1 spent once you join the Friend or VIP tiers.\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Points boost\\\",\\n      \\\"backgroundColor\\\": \\\"--gray-100\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"Get an exclusive Zenni Rewards case once you join the VIP tier.\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Free deluxe case\\\",\\n      \\\"backgroundColor\\\": \\\"--gray-100\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"widgetId\\\": \\\"three-card-variant-e-unlock-rewards\\\",\\n  \\\"sectionTitle\\\": \\\"Unlock rewards as you go\\\",\\n  \\\"widgetHeaderAlign\\\": \\\"center\\\"\\n}\",\"global.plp.angleView.label\":\"Angle view\",\"account.referFriends.description\":\"Spread the love, share the savings! Share a $15 off coupon with friends and earn 300 points ($15 in Rewards) when they place their first purchase.\",\"pdp.standard.shape\":\"Shape\",\"pdp.standard.availableAs\":\"Available as\",\"pdp.standard.pdRange\":\"PD Range\",\"pdp.standard.detailsFrameSize\":\"FRAME SIZE\",\"pdp.standard.detailsFrameWidth\":\"Frame Width\",\"pdp.standard.rim\":\"Rim\",\"pdp.all.tryOn\":\"TRY ON\",\"pdp.all.removeFavorites\":\"REMOVE\",\"pdp.all.ReviewsTab\":\"Reviews\",\"pdp.all.descriptionTab\":\"Description\",\"pdp.all.detailsTab\":\"Details\",\"pdp.all.share\":\"SHARE\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupKidsMediumValue\":\"120 - 129 mm; age 8-12 yrs*\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupKidsLarge\":\"large:\",\"pdp.standard.selectLenses\":\"SELECT LENSES\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupKidsMedium\":\"medium:\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupKidsSmallValue\":\"115 - 119 mm; age 4-7 yrs*\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupKidsLargeValue\":\"130+ mm; age 13-19 yrs*\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupAdultMedium\":\"medium:\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupAdultLargeValue\":\"140+ mm\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupAdultLarge\":\"large:\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupKidsExtraSmall\":\"extra-small:\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupAdultMediumValue\":\"135 - 139 mm\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupKidsSmall\":\"small:\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupFrameWidth\":\"FRAME WIDTH\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupAdultSmall\":\"small:\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupAdultExtraSmall\":\"extra-small:\",\"pdp.standard.reviews\":\"REVIEWS\",\"Label.PdpPage.CrossSell.ReadLess\":\"Read Less\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupAdultSmallValue\":\"128 - 134 mm\",\"Label.PdpPage.AddToCart\":\"ADD TO CART\",\"Label.PdpPage.CrossSell.ReadMore\":\"Read More\",\" Filter.DisplayName.bridge\":\"Bridge\",\"Test.Home.ABC\":\"ABC\",\"Label.PdpPage.CrossSell.Header\":\"Customers also bought with this frame.\",\"Label.HelpTips.Size\":\"{\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"SIZE CHART\\\",\\n  \\\"children\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"label\\\": \\\"Adult\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"FRAME WIDTH\\\",\\n      \\\"children\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"extra-small\\\": \\\"110 - 127 mm\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"small\\\": \\\"128 - 134 mm\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"medium\\\": \\\"135 - 139 mm\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"large\\\": \\\"140+ mm\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"label\\\": \\\"Kids\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"FRAME WIDTH\\\",\\n      \\\"children\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"extra-small\\\": \\\"100 - 114 mm; age 1-3 yrs*\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"small\\\": \\\"115 - 119 mm; age 4-7 yrs*\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"medium\\\": \\\"120 - 129 mm; age 8-12 yrs*\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"large\\\": \\\"130+ mm; age 13-19 yrs*\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n\",\"pdp.standard.new\":\"NEW\",\"Egc.Purchase.Form.Description\":\"\u003cp className=\\\"m-0\\\"\u003e\\n  Enter the details in the fields provided below. Upon purchase, an email will be\\n  sent automatically to the recipient with the gift card details and instructions.\\n  \u003ca\\n    className=\\\"terms-conditions fw-normal text-decoration-none\\\"\\n    href=\\\"/c/gift-card-tnc\\\"\\n  \u003e\\n    Terms \u0026amp; Conditions\\n  \u003c/a\u003e\\n\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Egc.Purchase.Form.Button\":\"Add To Cart\",\"pdp.egc.Email.Error.Message\":\"  \u003cspan class=\\\"color-warning\\\"\u003e\\n                  We\u0026apos;re unable to validate this email address. Please double-check and confirm\\n                  that it\u0026apos;s correct.\u0026nbsp;\\n                \u003c/span\u003e\\n                \u003cspan class=\\\"color-primary margin-top-20 fw-normal margin-left-5 text-center\\\"\u003e\\n                  \u003ca class=\\\"text-decoration-none\\\"onclick=\\\"window.handleValidEmailMessage()\\\"\u003eIt\u0026apos;s correct!\u003c/a\u003e\\n                \u003c/span\u003e\",\"Egc.ChooseDetail\":\"Choose E-GIFT Card Details\",\"Egc.Label.Recommended\":\"recommended\",\"Egc.Product.Description\":\"A Zenni gift card is a unique and thoughtful gift anytime of the year. We'll email it directly to the recipient with a personal message from you.\",\"plp.filterbox.framefit.tips\":\"or use Zenni Frame Fit ®\",\"Egc.Pdp.Details.Txt\":\"\u003cp class=\\\"color-text m-0\\\"\u003e\\n  This holiday season through Zenni's Gifts That Give initiative, we're donating 25% of gift\\n  card sales to the non-profit Prevent Blindness. These funds will provide vision screening\\n  certification scholarships to professionals in under-resourced communities. Scholarship\\n  recipients will also receive Zenni glasses vouchers to distribute to the communities they\\n  serve.\\n\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"normal-text\\\"\u003e\\n  \u003cp\u003e\\n    A Zenni gift card is a great gift for someone who wears prescription glasses or anyone who\\n    would love to customize a pair of non-prescription sunglasses.\\n    \u003cbr /\u003e\\n    \u003cbr /\u003e Simply pick an amount, enter the recipient's details, and a personal message\\n    (optional), then add to your cart. Once your purchase is complete, an email will be sent\\n    automatically to the recipient with the gift card details and instructions.\\n    \u003cbr /\u003e\\n    \u003cbr /\u003e For full terms and conditions, \u003ca href=\\\"/c/gift-card-tnc\\\"\u003eclick here\u003c/a\u003e.\\n  \u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003c/div\u003e\",\"search.noResult.workTime\":\"5am - 9pm PT every day\",\"Egc.RecommendAmountMessage\":\"We recommend $75 to cover most frames, lenses, plus any special add-ons like premium coatings and/or tints.\",\"Egc.Product.Title\":\"Gift Card\",\"plp.filterbox.filter\":\"FILTER:\",\"plp.filterbox.tryOn\":\"TRY ON\",\"search.noResult.callUs\":\"Give us call at:\",\"global.search.learn\":\"LEARN\",\"plp.search.returned0Result\":\"returned 0 result\",\"plp.filterbox.sortBy\":\"Sort By\",\"global.search.recentSearches\":\"RECENT SEARCHES\",\"global.header.account\":\"account\",\"global.search.popularCategories\":\"POPULAR CATEGORIES\",\"global.header.favorites\":\"Favorites\",\"global.header.miniCart\":\"Cart\",\"global.header.help\":\"Help\",\"pdp.standard.tooltipsProgressive\":\"Progressive\",\"pdp.standard.tooltipsBifocalParagraph3\":\"$undefined\",\"global.header.login\":\"Login\",\"global.header.searchIcon\":\"Search\",\"pdp.standard.tooltipsAdvisoryForReaders\":\"Advisory for Readers\",\"pdp.standard.tooltipsAdvisoryForReadersParagraph1\":\"$undefined\",\"pdp.standard.tooltipsBifocalParagraph1\":\"$undefined\",\"pdp.standard.tooltipsPdRangeParagraph1\":\"$undefined\",\"pdp.standard.detailsFrameWeight\":\"Frame Weight\",\"pdp.standard.tooltipsBifocalParagraph2\":\"$undefined\",\"pdp.standard.tooltipsPdRangeParagraph2\":\"$undefined\",\"pdp.standard.tooltipsBifocal\":\"Bifocal\",\"pdp.standard.detailsLensHeight\":\"Lens Height\",\"pdp.standard.detailsLength\":\"Temple Length\",\"pdp.standard.detailsLensWidth\":\"Lens Width\",\"pdp.standard.detailsBridge\":\"Bridge\",\"pdp.clipon.Modal.Cancel.Text\":\"CANCEL\",\"pdp.egc.enterFirstName\":\"Please enter first name.\",\"Label.HelpTips.Clipon.348112J\":\"Additional clip-on sunshade for selected frame.\",\"pdp.clipon.No.Results.Text\":\"\u003cdiv class=\\\"no-results-wrapper\\\"\u003e\\n        \u003cstrong\u003eWe're sorry...!\u003c/strong\u003e We currently do not have clip-ons for this frame.\\n        Please click\u0026nbsp;\\n        \u003ca class=\\\"fw-bold\\\" href=\\\"/cliponFinder\\\"\u003e\\n          here\\n        \u003c/a\u003e\\n        \u0026nbsp;to order clip-ons for another frame.\\n      \u003c/div\u003e\",\"pdp.reviews.color\":\"Color\",\"pdp.oos.youReminder\":\"YOUR REMINDER HAS BEEN SUBMITTED\",\"pdp.oos.signUp\":\"SIGN UP\",\"pdp.reviews.noReviewsMessage\":\"We are having trouble loading this content. Please try again later!\",\"pdp.oos.message2\":\"Sign up to be notified when this item is back in stock.\",\"pdp.reviews.readFullReview\":\"Read full review\",\"pdp.oos.emailBoxPlaceholder\":\"Enter your email to receive updates\",\"pdp.reviews.verifiedBuyer\":\"Verified Buyer\",\"pdp.egc.yourName\":\"Your name\",\"pdp.egc.charactersRemaining\":\"characters remaining\",\"pdp.egc.messagePlaceholder\":\"I can't wait to see your new Zennis!\",\"pdp.reviews.wouldRecommentdToFriend\":\"WOULD RECOMMEND TO A FRIEND.\",\"pdp.egc.message\":\"Message\",\"pdp.egc.from\":\"From\",\"pdp.egc.recommend\":\"RECOMMENED\",\"pdp.egc.to\":\"To\",\"pdp.egc.recipientEmail\":\"Recipient's email\",\"pdp.egc.recipientLasName\":\"Recipient's last name\",\"pdp.egc.recipientFirstName\":\"Recipient's first name\",\"pdp.egc.amount\":\"Amount\",\"pdp.clipon.orderSummary\":\"ORDER SUMMARY\",\"pdp.egc.chooseGiftCard\":\"CHOOSE E-GIFT CARD DETAILS\",\"pdp.egc.description\":\"A Zenni gift card is a unique and thoughtful gift anytime of the year. We'll email it directly to the recipient with a personal message from you.\",\"pdp.egc.recommendAmount\":\"We recommend $75 to cover most frames, lenses, plus any special add-ons like premium coatings and/or tints.\",\"pdp.clipon.quantity\":\"Quantity\",\"pdp.egc.giftCard\":\"GIFT CARD\",\"pdp.clipon.clipOnOrder\":\"Clip-On Order\",\"pdp.accessory.quantity\":\"Quantity\",\"pdp.sunglasses.selectTintLens\":\"SELECT LENS \u0026 TINT\",\"pdp.clipon.polarizedClipons\":\"POLARIZED CLIP-ONS\",\"pdp.clipon.selectClipOnFor\":\"Select a Clip-on for\",\"pdp.clipon.price\":\"Price\",\"pdp.standard.pricePaneldesc\":\"Zenni WOW Price\",\"pdp.standard.pricePaneldescValue\":\"Price includes frame + basic prescription lenses, anti-scratch coating \u0026 UV protection.\",\"search.noResult.youMayAlsoLike\":\"You May Also Like\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupKids\":\"Kids\",\"pdp.standard.tooltipsReaders\":\"$3c\",\"pdp.standard.tooltipsBifocalAndProgressive\":\"$3d\",\"sign.in.error.invalid.credentials\":\"This combination of user name and password is invalid.\",\"sign.in.welcome.back.to.zenni\":\"Welcome back to Zenni\",\"pdp.standard.tooltipsPrescriptionRange\":\"\u003cdiv class=\\\"title\\\"\u003ePrescription Range\u003c/div\u003e\\n\u003cbr /\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"message\\\"\u003e\\n  \u003cp\u003e\\n    These frames can only be made in certain prescriptions. This is an approximate\\n    range based on the spherical (SPH) value. If you have astigmatism (CYL) in\\n    your prescription, this range may be further limited. Please enter your\\n    prescription on the order page to check if we can make these\\n    glasses/sunglasses for you.\\n  \u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003c/div\u003e\",\"sign.in.log.in.to.my.zenni\":\"Log In To My Zenni\",\"global.walter\":\"Walter\",\"sign.in.password.placeholder\":\"Password\",\"sign.in.forgot.your.password\":\"Forgot Your Password?\",\"sign.out.account.overview\":\"Account Overview\",\"sign.out.hello\":\"Hello\",\"sign.out.log.out\":\"Log Out\",\"sign.out.my.orders\":\"My Orders\",\"sign.out.gift.card.balance\":\"Gift Card Balance\",\"clipons.differentFrame\":\"Please order for a different frame.\",\"clipons.popoverMessage\":\"How to locate your frame or lens number\",\"sign.out.my.favorites\":\"My Favorites\",\"clipons.PopoverChildren\":\"\u003cp className=\\\"clipon-tooltip-title\\\"\u003eFrame number\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e•\u003c/span\u003e Located on the inside of the temple arm.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp className=\\\"clipon-tooltip-title\\\"\u003eRimless glasses\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e•\u003c/span\u003e You\u0026apos;ll need the frame and lens number\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFind both under order history in \u003ca href=\\\"/myAccount/myOrders\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003eMy Account\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"pdp.egc.termsCondistion\":\"\u003cp className=\\\"m-0\\\"\u003e\\n  Enter the details in the fields provided below. Upon purchase, an email will be\\n  sent automatically to the recipient with the gift card details and instructions.\\n  \u003ca\\n    className=\\\"terms-conditions fw-normal text-decoration-none\\\"\\n    href=\\\"/c/gift-card-tnc\\\"\\n  \u003e\\n    Terms \u0026amp; Conditions\\n  \u003c/a\u003e\\n\u003c/p\u003e\",\"plp.search.yourSearchFor\":\"YOUR SEARCH FOR\",\"pdp.standard.specifications\":\"SPECIFICATIONS\",\"pdp.clipon.cliponSunglasses\":\"Clip-On Sunglasses\",\"global.search.suggested\":\"SUGGESTED\",\"clipons.title\":\"Find a Clip-On for Your Zennis\",\"pdp.standard.feature\":\"Feature\",\"pdp.clipon.estimatedTotal\":\"Estimated Total (USD)\\n\",\"pdp.egc.enterValidEmail\":\"Please enter email.\\n\",\"plp.products.showMore\":\"SHOW MORE\",\"search.noResult.haveQuestion\":\"Have a question?\",\"pdp.standard.tags\":\"Tags\",\"myAccount.tryOn.delete.cancel\":\"CLOSE WINDOW\",\"myAccount.tryOn.delete.delete\":\"YES, DELETE IT\",\"Label.HelpTips.Clipon.cosku100004\":\"\u003cdiv class=\\\"\\\"jspPane\\\"\\\" style=\\\"\\\"padding: 0px 4px; top: 0px; width: 540px;\\\"\\\"\u003e\\n    \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSunglasses Gradient Clip-On\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\\n    \u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\\n    \u003cp\u003eGradient clip-ons have a darker tint at the top and gradually get lighter at the bottom. The clip-ons are polarized to reduce glare and are cut sligthly larger than the optical lenses to provide full sun coverage.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\n\",\"myAccount.tryOn.delete.title\":\"ARE YOU SURE YOU WANT TO DELETE THE TRY-ON?\",\"myAccount.tryOn.delete.content\":\"Click on \\\"Yes, Delete it\\\" to delete the Try-On; Simply close this window to keep the try-on.\",\"Label.HelpTips.Clipon.cosku100008\":\"\u003chead/\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"\\\"helpMsgPane\\\"\\\"\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"\\\"jspPane\\\"\\\" style=\\\"\\\"padding: 0px 4px; top: 0px; width: 540px;\\\"\\\"\u003e\\n    \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMirror Clip-On\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\\n    \u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\\n    \u003cp\u003eTurn your glasses into instantly cool sunglasses with our polarized mirror clip-ons. The mirror clip-ons come with oleophobic anti-reflective coating to reduce fingerprints and glare. To provide full sun coverage, clip-ons are cut slightly larger than the optical lenses.\\n\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\n\",\"Label.HelpTips.Clipon.cosku100007\":\"\u003chead/\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"\\\"helpMsgPane\\\"\\\"\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"\\\"jspPane\\\"\\\" style=\\\"\\\"padding: 0px 4px; top: 0px; width: 540px;\\\"\\\"\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNight Driving Clip-On\u003c/strong\u003e(Yellow tint).\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eOur night driving clip-ons enhance contrast, and reduce glare from oncoming car headlights while driving at night. These clip-on lenses have a yellow color, and the included double-sided anti-reflective coating is designed to minimize glare from surrounding light.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eThe clip-ons are cut slightly larger than the optical lenses to provide full coverage.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\n\u003c/div\u003e\",\"pdp.egc.PleaseEnterName\":\"Please enter name.\",\"pdp.egc.enterLastName\":\"Please enter last name.\",\"Label.HelpTips.Clipon.cosku100001\":\"\u003cdiv class=\\\"\\\"jspPane\\\"\\\" style=\\\"\\\"padding: 0px 4px; top: 0px; width: 540px;\\\"\\\"\u003e\\n    \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSunglass Clip-On\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\\n    \u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\\n    \u003cp\u003eThese classic clip-ons feature a polarized tint to reduce glare. The tint is a solid color. To provide full sun coverage, clip-ons are cut slightly larger than the optical lenses.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\n\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChart\":\"Size Chart\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupAdult\":\"Adult\",\"sign.in.error.captcha\":\"Captcha validation failed. Please try again.\",\"pdp.retired.message\":\"This color is now enjoying its well-deserved retirement.\",\"my.dashboard.print.fsa.hsa\":\"Print FSA/HSA Receipt\",\"pdp.standard.sizeChartPopupAdultExtraSmallValue\":\"110 - 127 mm\",\"back-in-stock-error-email-already-register\":\"User already signed up for back in stock notification service\",\"forgot.your.password.explain\":\"Simply enter your email address here! After clicking submit we'll email you a link to a page where you can easily create a new password.\",\"my.dashboard.you.have.no.orders\":\"You have no orders.\",\"back-in-stock-error-generic\":\"There was an error processing the request\",\"back-in-stock-error-invalid-sku\":\"Invalid Sku for back in stock notification sign up service\",\"my.dashboard.my.order\":\"My Orders\",\"add-to-cart-error-incompatible-clipons\":\"One or more clip-ons are incompatible with the frame\",\"add-to-cart-error-egift-card-wrong-type\":\"\\t\\nThe ProductType of the SKU is not an egiftcard.\",\"rules-engine-error-generic-error\":\"Response data is not present\",\"add-to-cart-error-non-configurable-frame-wrong-type\":\"Frame SKU is not of type NonConfigurableFrame.\",\"zenni-gateway-error-jwt-expired\":\"$undefined\",\"add-to-cart-error-one-or-more-products-disabled\":\"One or more products are disabled.\",\"add-to-cart-error-clipons-not-found\":\"One or more ClipOns were not found.\",\"add-to-cart-error-lens-bundle-wrong-type\":\"Lens Bundle SKU is not of type LensBundle.\",\"add-to-cart-error-accessory-wrong-type\":\"The ProductType of the SKU is not an accessory\",\"add-to-cart-error-frame-wrong-type\":\"Frame SKU is not of type ConfigurableFrame.\",\"add-to-cart-error-lens-shape-wrong-type\":\"Lens Shape SKU is required for Rimless frames.\",\"add-to-cart-error-no-store\":\"The Store ID is not available\",\"product-details-service-error\":\"Failed to get product details from CommerceTools \",\"back-in-stock-monitoring-error-generic\":\"An unexpected error happened during request.\",\"customer-service-warning-customer-not-found\":\"The email that the user is trying to recover the password was not found in CT.\",\"back-in-stock-monitoring-error-data-not-received\":\"The required params were not sent to the server.\",\"customer-service-error-forgot-password\":\"\\t\\nIt was not possible to send the forgot password email to the user.\",\"auth-service-error-registration\":\"Already has a customer with the provided email.\",\"email-service-error-forgot-password-email-generic\":\"An unexpected error happened during request.\",\"email-service-error-generic\":\"The email was not sent due to system error.\",\"add-to-cart-error-item-not-added-to-cart\":\"Error related To quantity, SKU, or cart ID not available or invalid input\",\"auth-service-error-getting-token\":\"The token was not generated due to system error.\",\"email-service-error-data-not-received\":\"The required params were not sent to the server.\",\"au